                                                "example_id": "9e9b5497-c072-421e-a65a-5059927c48cd",
                                                "sense_id": "1f9d2de2-ad10-3f6f-a21a-a9ce3a964999",
                                                "text": "The needy poet sticks to all he meets,\nCoached, carted, trod upon, now loose, now fast.\nAnd carried off in some dog's tail at last"
